<section class="section pb-problem fade-in" aria-labelledby="pb-problem-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pb-problem-grid">

      <div class="pb-problem-left">
        <span class="section-label pb-problem-label">The Gap</span>
        <h2 class="headline-lg" id="pb-problem-title">
          Your clients are already growing.<br />
          Just not through you.
        </h2>

        <p class="pb-problem-subhead">That changes.</p>

        <ul class="pb-problem-list">
          <li>
            <span class="pb-problem-icon">📊</span>
            <div>
              <strong>No visibility into member performance</strong>
              <p>Your clients run their businesses on ten different tools. You see none of them. You can't advise on what you can't measure.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="pb-problem-icon">🔄</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Retention erodes as clients grow stronger</strong>
              <p>The better your clients get at running their business, the less they depend on you. That relationship dynamic is backwards.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="pb-problem-icon">💸</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Relationships stay transactional</strong>
              <p>You provide products or services. They buy elsewhere when the price is right. There is no platform holding the relationship together.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="pb-problem-icon">🏗️</span>
            <div>
              <strong>You cannot deliver on "digital"</strong>
              <p>Every organisation in every sector promises to help clients go digital. Almost none of them have an actual product to deliver.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="pb-problem-solution">
        <span class="section-label pb-network-label">Pagayo changes that</span>
        <h3 class="headline-md">Your network becomes the operating layer.</h3>

        <ul class="pb-solution-list">
          <li>Every member gets a full commerce platform, delivered through you</li>
          <li>You see member performance across the entire network in real time</li>
          <li>Your clients grow on your platform, not someone else's</li>
          <li>Your role shifts from vendor to ecosystem — harder to replace every day</li>
          <li>One dashboard. Every member. Full network visibility.</li>
        </ul>

        <blockquote class="pb-quote">
          "Your network is your most valuable asset. Right now, it is not working hard enough."
        </blockquote>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
